,24,11]},"desc":"A sealed basin broke open and a living Mesozoic world spilled out. The Trust can't fence it, so it licenses hunters.\n\nRead the wind. Follow footprints and blood. Glass a herd from a ridge, then close in on the one animal you came for. Every dinosaur is an individual, with its own weight, age and temperament, and every wound leaves a trail that leads back to that animal.\n\n• 17 dinosaur species to hunt or tranquilize, from Gallimimus to Tyrannosaurus, plus smaller wildlife\n• 5 reserves: Kettle Hollow, Blackwater Fen, Ochre Mesa, Thornveil Canopy and Ashfall Caldera\n• 14 weapons, rifles to longbow, crossbow and tranquilizer: drop, energy and shot placement count\n• Day, dusk, night and weather change what you can see and what can hear you\n• Predators hunt the herds too, and they come to investigate a gunshot\n• Permits from Trainee to Primeval: sharper senses and bigger scores\n• Trophies, rare colors, challenges and leaderboards\n\nPatience pays. Clean shots score highest.","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-72479c5a9261da707d548989ddc3161c/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-364084c6ef863d014941e486abdf325a/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-81bcb76751a24c6e74420ae463bfc564/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}